**** Changes from 2026.08.19 (onken)

- Fixed invalid downcast for non-UL group length VR:
  DcmMetaInfo::readGroupLength() cast (0002,0000) to DcmUnsignedLong*
  based on the tag alone; a crafted file with a non-UL VR made this an
  invalid downcast. Only cast when the element's VR is actually UL.
  Thanks to glitchfox (Benjamin Ali) for the report and analysis.
  This closes DCMTK issue #1276.
  Affects: dcmdata/libsrc/dcmetinf.cc

**** Changes from 2026.08.14 (onken)

- Fixed TrcTrackSet::getTrackSetNumber():
  The getter used findAndGetUint16() although Track Set Number
  (0066,0105) has VR UL, so it always failed with EC_IllegalCall and
  never returned a value. Changed the parameter and the lookup to
  Uint32. Added a regression check to the dcmtract_create test.
  Thanks to GitHub user "ppmartel" (Phil Martel) for the report and fix.
  Affects: dcmtract/include/dcmtk/dcmtract/trctrackset.h
           dcmtract/libsrc/trctrackset.cc
           dcmtract/tests/tcreate.cc

- Regenerated Makefile dependencies.
  Affects: dcmdata/tests/Makefile.dep
