**** Changes from 2026.06.17 (onken)

- Allow N-ACTION-RQ without dataset:
  Make sure a missing dataset in an N-ACTION request is announced
  correctly on the network via DcmSCU, and ensure that DcmSCP can
  deal with such requests.
  Affects: dcmnet/libsrc/scp.cc
           dcmnet/libsrc/scu.cc

- Don't log select() EINTR as a network error:
  EINTR just means select() was interrupted by a signal and the caller
  retries; logging it as an error is misleading noise (common with
  multi-threaded SCPs). Log a benign retry message instead.
  Affects: dcmnet/libsrc/diutil.cc

- Allow to override RequestedSOPClassUID in DcmSCU:
