**** Changes from 2026.04.06 (eichelberg)

- Replaced call to system() with portable alternative:
  Replaced the call to system(3) with a more portable alternative, i.e.
  fork() and execl() on Posix systems and CreateProcessA() on Windows.
  This should allow DCMTK to be compiled on iOS where the system(3) call
  is not available.
  Affects: dcmdata/libsrc/dcdocdec.cc

