- Create missing time components only on demand:
  Added optional "createMissingPart" parameter to some getXXX() methods
  to create missing time components only on demand, i.e. seconds and
  fraction of seconds. A default time zone ("+0000") is not added any
  more, if no value is specified.
  In order to support this new feature, a hasFractionOfSecond() method
  has been added to the OFTime class.
  Also made source code formatting in VR classes more consistent.
