           dcmsr/libsrc/dsrdtitn.cc
           dcmsr/libsrc/dsrtimtn.cc

- Changed default time zone to "unspecified":
  Now, the default time zone is "unspecified" instead of the local time
  zone. This applies to DcmTime and DcmDateTime when retrieving the
  current time or date/time as a OFTime or OFDateTime, respectively.
  Also removed redundant variants of getOF...FromString().
