  Made "seconds" part of a time and date/time value optional. This is true
  for the "ofstd" classes OFTime and OFDateTime as well as for the methods
  DcmTime::getOFTimeFromString() and DcmDateTime::getOFDateTimeFromString().
  Also the "read XML" methods and the XML Schema of the "dcmsr" module have
  been adapted.
