**** Changes from 2026.02.18 (eichelberg)

- Fixed big endian issue in DiImage::convertPixelData():
  Fixed an issue in DiImage::convertPixelData() where the pixel data of
  compressed images was treated as being in OB value representation,
  while the decoders called by getUncompressedFrame() actually
  return data in OW value representation. This caused the byte order
  to be treated incorrectly on big endian systems in certain cases.
  This commit also reverts commit #3fb01bf8f ("Fixed big endian issue in
  decodeFrame()"), which addressed this problem in the wrong place.
  Affects: dcmdata/libsrc/dcrleccd.cc
           dcmimgle/libsrc/diimage.cc
           dcmjpeg/libsrc/djcodecd.cc
           dcmjpls/libsrc/djcodecd.cc

