- Fixed big endian issue in decodeFrame():
  Fixed an issue that caused implementations of the DcmCodec::decodeFrame()
  method to produce pixel data with incorrect byte swapping on big endian
  systems (such as SPARC and S/390). DcmCodec::decode() (i.e. the method
  that decodes an entire image with all frames) was not affected.
  Affects: dcmdata/libsrc/dcrleccd.cc
           dcmjpeg/libsrc/djcodecd.cc
           dcmjpls/libsrc/djcodecd.cc

