**** Changes from 2026.02.06 (onken)

- Added MDC filter capabilities to oflog:
  Added MDC (Mapped Diagnostic Context) filter to oflog. MDC allows
  attaching information to threads in the form of key/value pairs. Logging
  can then be configured to match ("filter") on these key/value pairs in
  order to decide whether the thread at hand should log, and how.
  This commit only adds the missing filter to "react" on the attached
  MDC info. This can be used for example to let multiple threads in an
  application log to different outputs (e.g. files).
  The MDC filter has been backported from log4cplus version 2.1.2.
  Affects: oflog/include/dcmtk/oflog/spi/filter.h
           oflog/libsrc/filter.cc

