**** Changes from 2026.01.27 (riesmeier)

- Don't search for PixelDataProviderURL in subitems:
  Only search in the top-level data set for the PixelDataProviderURL
  (0028,7FE0), as it is only contained in the Image Pixel Module (see
  DICOM PS3.3 Section C.7.6.3). This will e.g. allow for storing this
  data element inside the OriginalAttributesSequence (0400,0561).
  Thanks to GitHub user "malaterre" for the proposal.
  This closes GitHub PR #132.
  Affects: dcmdata/libsrc/dcdatset.cc

