**** Changes from 2026.01.15 (eichelberg)

- Silently convert path separators in dump2dcm:
  When reading a dump file created by dcmdump, dump2dcm will now silently
  convert path separators to the convention used on the local platform,
  thus improving interoperability between dumps created on Windows
  and dumps created on a Posix platform. Both platforms will now accept
  dumps created on the other platform if relative filenames are used
  for the dcmdump --write-pixel option.
  This closes DCMTK issue #246.
  Affects: dcmdata/apps/dump2dcm.cc

- Fixed minor memory leak in oficonv:
  Fixed a minor memory leak due to a static object not being freed
  by a call to OFiconv_cleanup().
  Affects: oficonv/libsrc/citrus_csmapper.c
           oficonv/libsrc/citrus_csmapper.h
           oficonv/libsrc/citrus_mapper.c
           oficonv/libsrc/citrus_mapper.h
           oficonv/libsrc/oficonv_iconv.c

**** Changes from 2026.01.14 (onken)

- Make SCU dataset logging configurable:
  C-FIND-RQ, C-FIND-RSP and C-STORE-RQ datasets are now logged to separate
  loggers. All log to the DEBUG log level. Each of them can be enabled
  or disabled individually for each DcmSCU instance.
  Loggers / configurability for further datasets (N-SET, C-MOVE, etc.)
  can be added later.
  This closes GitHub PR #134 and #135.
  Affects: dcmnet/include/dcmtk/dcmnet/scu.h
           dcmnet/libsrc/scu.cc
           oflog/include/dcmtk/oflog/oflog.h
           oflog/libsrc/oflog.cc

**** Changes from 2026.01.13 (eichelberg)

- Fixed minor gcc -Wextra warning.
  Affects: oficonv/include/dcmtk/oficonv/iconv.h

**** Changes from 2026.01.12 (eichelberg)

- Fixed possible segfault in dcmpschk application:
  Fixed a possible segmentation fault that could occur if dcmpschk read
  a specially crafted DICOM file.
  Thanks to Naavin Ravinthran <naavinravi@gmail.com> for the bug report and fix.
  This closes DCMTK issue #1187.
  Affects: dcmpstat/apps/dcmpschk.cc

**** Changes from 2026.01.07 (riesmeier)

- Link dcmimage privately to libtiff and libpng:
  Link dcmimage privately to libtiff and libpng because they are not used
  by the interface. This avoids unnecessary dependencies.
  This should fix openSUSE Bug 1254123.
  Thanks to GitHub user "Vogtinator" for the proposal (see PR #138).
  Affects: dcmimage/libsrc/CMakeLists.txt

**** Changes from 2026.01.06 (eichelberg)

- Added DcmJsonFormat::getMinBulkSize():
  Added a method DcmJsonFormat::getMinBulkSize() that allows user code,
  in particular a derived class, to access the minimum attribute size
  for bulk data.
  Thanks to Mathieu Maleterre <mathieu.malaterre@gmail.com> for the suggestion.
  Affects: dcmdata/include/dcmtk/dcmdata/dcjson.h

**** Changes from 2025.12.31 (riesmeier)

- Added test case with a backslash-like byte:
  Added test case with a backslash-like byte in a multi-byte character
  (for Specific Character Set "\ISO 2022 IR 87").
  Thanks to GitHub user "mrbean-bremen" for the proposed patch (see
  discussion on PR #124).
  This finally closes DCMTK Bug #684.
  Affects: dcmdata/tests/tspchrs.cc

- Updated libiconv version number.
  Affects: INSTALL

**** Changes from 2025.12.30 (onken)

- Added some optional return keys.
  Affects: dcmwlm/docs/wlmscpfs.man
           dcmwlm/libsrc/wlds.cc

**** Changes from 2025.12.27 (riesmeier)

- Also test Japanese character sets with "oficonv":
  Enabled tests of the Japanese character sets "ISO 2022 IR 87" and "ISO
  2022 IR 159" when using the "oficonv" conversion library.
  Thanks to GitHub user "mrbean-bremen" for pointing this out (see PR #124).
  Affects: dcmdata/tests/tspchrs.cc

**** Changes from 2025.12.24 (riesmeier)

- Fixed issue with delimiters in Chinese encodings:
  Fixed issue with non-ASCII characters in the Chinese character sets
  GBK and GB18030 being incorrectly detected as delimiters, such as a
  backslash (05/12).
  Thanks to GitHub user "mrbean-bremen" for the proposed patch and
  Mathieu Malaterre <mathieu.malaterre@gmail.com> for the test case.
  This (hopefully) closes DCMTK Bug #684.
  Affects: dcmdata/include/dcmtk/dcmdata/dcspchrs.h
           dcmdata/libsrc/dcspchrs.cc
           dcmdata/tests/tspchrs.cc

**** Changes from 2025.12.19 (eichelberg)

- Added dependency check between command line options:
  Added dependency check that will cause an error message if the command line
  option --output-directory is specified, but none of the options for
  extracting DICOM messages (e.g. --extract or --extract-xml) is specified.
  Thanks to Vladimir Poluchaevskiy <vladimir.poluchaevskiy@visus.com>
  for the suggestion.
  Affects: dcmnet/apps/findscu.cc

